<!-- Trailer. A 16:9 screen with the bar's own play mark inside it, drawn as
     geometry like the rest of the row (see ic_detail_shuffle) instead of the
     Material film-strip glyph - a film strip is perforations and sprocket
     holes, which is mush at header-row size, and it matched nothing else on
     the screen.

     Frame is four bars, 2.2 units like every other bar (the same construction
     ic_player_subtitle uses for its caption box, at a wider aspect so the two
     cannot be mistaken for each other), and the mark inside is the play
     triangle from ic_player_play: a vertical base with the tip to the right,
     here 4.4 units tall so it sits in the frame with a unit of clearance.
     Carries kb_text_hi (#FFF3EFE4) baked in. -->
